{"1965650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "IMA Miner", "steam_appid": 1965650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap into your drill ship, point it straight down, and don't look up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IMA Miner is a game about greed and gravity. Punch through a sprawling procedural underground one layer at a time — the deeper you go, the better it pays. Richer ore. Rarer finds. Weirder stuff. The catch: none of it's worth anything until you haul it back to the surface, and your fuel won't last. Go too deep, and the climb home becomes the most dangerous part of the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your haul up top, bolt upgrades onto your ship, and dive again — a little further each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dig. Get rich. Push your luck.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend a massive procedurally generated underground</strong> — layers of dirt, rock, ore, and things you probably weren't expecting to find.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965650/extras/152044a32c01773d02017e8aca2b4ec0.avif?t=1780538404\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965650/extras_big/152044a32c01773d02017e8aca2b4ec0.avif?t=1780538404 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your drill ship</strong> — a better drill, a bigger fuel tank, more cargo space, a larger engine, or a brighter light. Each upgrade will allow you to reach farther into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine ore and buried treasure</strong> — the good stuff hides deep, and it pays for everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965650/extras/b4556d45cbfcbdec90ab52953e680a2e.avif?t=1780538404\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965650/extras_big/b4556d45cbfcbdec90ab52953e680a2e.avif?t=1780538404 width=1560 height=652 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pack fuel, dynamite, and flares</strong> — for boulders, stubborn geology, and things that won't negotiate. Make sure to keep enough fuel for the climb back. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New in 2.0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The biggest update yet </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A day/night cycle and weather that shifts around you while you dig.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overhauled visuals, audio, and lighting throughout the underground.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable skins tied to achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support and a native Linux build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Cloud saves. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >???</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How far down will you  go?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It knows you're coming. Drill carefully.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strap into your drill ship, point it straight down, and don't look up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IMA Miner is a game about greed and gravity. Punch through a sprawling procedural underground one layer at a time — the deeper you go, the better it pays. Richer ore. Rarer finds. Weirder stuff. The catch: none of it's worth anything until you haul it back to the surface, and your fuel won't last. Go too deep, and the climb home becomes the most dangerous part of the run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your haul up top, bolt upgrades onto your ship, and dive again — a little further each time.</p><